        "subject": "=Your Cleaning Estimate - {{ $json.estimateId }}",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;\">\n\n  <p>Hi {{ $json['Customer Name'] }},</p>\n\n  <p>Thank you for reaching out! Here's a summary of your estimate:</p>\n\n  <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:20px 0;\">\n    <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Estimate ID</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json['Estimate ID'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Customer Name</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json['Customer Name'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Email</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.Email }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Service Type</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json['Service Type'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Bedrooms</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.Bedrooms }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Bathrooms</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.Bathrooms }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"background:#f5f5f5;\">\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>ZIP Code</strong></td>\n      <td style=\"padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json['ZIP Code'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px; text-align:center; margin:20px 0;\">\n    Your total estimate amount is: \n    <strong style=\"color:#00897B; font-size:22px;\">${{ $json['Estimate Amount'] }}</strong>\n  </p>\n\n  <p>We'd love to get you booked in! Click the button below to \n  confirm your appointment.</p>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align:center; margin:30px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://cebin99345.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/booking-update?estimateId={{ $('Generate Estimate ID & Dates').item.json.estimateId }}&status=Booked\"\n   style=\"background-color:#00897B; color:white; padding:14px 28px;\n   text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:bold;\n   font-size:16px;\">\n  ✅ Confirm My Booking\n</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>If you have any questions, we're happy to help.</p>\n\n  <p>Best regards,<br>\n  <strong>CleanFlow</strong></p>\n\n</div>",
